---
import ToolShell from '../../../components/tool-shell/ToolShell.astro';
---

<ToolShell labelledBy="frame-skipping-tool-heading">
  <h2 id="frame-skipping-tool-heading" class="frame-skipping-tool__sr">Frame Skipping Test camera pattern</h2>

  <div class="frame-skipping-tool" data-frame-skipping-test data-state="warming">
    <div class="frame-skipping-tool__status-row">
      <span class="frame-skipping-tool__signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <strong data-frame-skipping-status role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
        Warming up browser timing…
      </strong>
      <span class="frame-skipping-tool__status-note">Runs automatically while this page is visible.</span>
    </div>

    <p class="frame-skipping-tool__instruction">
      Wait for READY, then photograph the moving block pattern with a camera.
    </p>

    <div class="frame-skipping-pattern">
      <div class="frame-skipping-pattern__label" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Camera pattern</span>
        <span>48 slots</span>
      </div>
      <canvas
        class="frame-skipping-pattern__canvas"
        data-frame-skipping-canvas
        width="960"
        height="160"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Frame-skipping camera pattern. While READY, one bright square advances exactly one slot for each stable browser frame."
      ></canvas>
      <p>While READY, each accepted browser frame advances exactly one consecutive slot. Browser timing never inserts a visual gap.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="frame-skipping-steps" aria-label="How to capture the frame skipping pattern">
      <li><strong>Wait for READY.</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Use a camera.</strong> Photograph the moving blocks.</li>
      <li><strong>Use about 1/10 s or longer.</strong> Several blocks should appear.</li>
      <li><strong>Screenshots do not work.</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Look for repeatable gaps</strong> in valid READY photos.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="frame-skipping-examples" aria-label="Photo interpretation examples">
      <div>
        <span>Continuous example</span>
        <div class="frame-example" aria-hidden="true">
          <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>Gap example</span>
        <div class="frame-example frame-example--gap" aria-hidden="true">
          <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Repeatable gaps across multiple valid READY photos may indicate display skipping. Camera exposure or photographing outside READY can also produce a bad capture.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="frame-skipping-tool__sr" data-frame-skipping-accessible-summary aria-live="polite">
      Frame Skipping pattern is warming up browser timing.
    </p>
  </div>
</ToolShell>

<script>
  import { mountFrameSkippingTest } from './frame-skipping-controller';

  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-frame-skipping-test]');
  if (root) {
    const controller = mountFrameSkippingTest(root);
    window.addEventListener('pagehide', (event) => {
      if (event.persisted) {
        controller.stop();
        return;
      }
      controller.destroy();
    });
    window.addEventListener('pageshow', (event) => {
      if (event.persisted) controller.start();
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .frame-skipping-tool {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__status-row {
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__status-row strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__status-note {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__signal {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid #aeb4b7;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #dfe2e3;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool[data-state='ready'] .frame-skipping-tool__signal {
    border-color: var(--color-signal);
    background: var(--color-signal);
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool[data-state='unavailable'] .frame-skipping-tool__signal {
    border-color: #8c5555;
    background: #b36a6a;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__instruction,
  .frame-skipping-pattern p,
  .frame-skipping-examples p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__instruction {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .frame-skipping-pattern {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    border-block: 1px solid #e3e6e7;
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
  }

  .frame-skipping-pattern__label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.055em;
  }

  .frame-skipping-pattern__canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 10rem;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid #252829;
    background: #000;
  }

  .frame-skipping-pattern p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .frame-skipping-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: capture-step;
  }

  .frame-skipping-steps li {
    min-width: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e3e6e7;
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    counter-increment: capture-step;
  }

  .frame-skipping-steps li::before {
    content: counter(capture-step, decimal-leading-zero);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.22rem;
    color: var(--color-signal);
    font: 600 0.68rem/1 var(--font-mono);
  }

  .frame-skipping-steps strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .frame-skipping-examples {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid #e3e6e7;
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .frame-skipping-examples > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .frame-skipping-examples > div > span {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.045em;
  }

  .frame-example {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.18rem;
  }

  .frame-example i {
    width: 0.48rem;
    height: 0.48rem;
    display: block;
    background: var(--color-signal);
  }

  .frame-example--gap i:nth-child(5) {
    visibility: hidden;
  }

  .frame-skipping-examples p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .frame-skipping-tool__sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .frame-skipping-tool__status-row {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .frame-skipping-tool__status-note {
      width: 100%;
      margin-left: 1.1rem;
    }

    .frame-skipping-pattern__canvas {
      height: 7.5rem;
    }

    .frame-skipping-steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .frame-skipping-steps li:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .frame-skipping-examples {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }

    .frame-skipping-examples p {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
